sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant J as Journal
  participant H as HTTP Executor
  participant R as Receiver
  participant O as Observer
  participant A as Assertion Engine
  S->>J: commit claim + sending intent
  J-->>S: attempt_id durable
  S->>H: exact bytes + pinned destination
  H->>R: POST webhook
  R-->>H: 204
  H->>J: append acknowledged evidence
  S->>O: observe checkpoint
  O-->>J: append typed sample
  J->>A: transport + state evidence
  A->>J: append pass/fail evaluation
